      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5353_Start4" name="Customer returns leftover paint at the take-back counter">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5353_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5353_Task5" name="Verify eligibility/quantity per policy (W5350); inspect container (labeled, not…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Verify eligibility/quantity per policy (W5350); inspect container (labeled, not mixed with other waste).
Responsible (R): Take-Back Associate
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5353_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5353_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5353_Task6" name="Sort by type: water-based (latex/acrylic) vs. oil/solvent-based; separate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sort by type: water-based (latex/acrylic) vs. oil/solvent-based; separate non-paint (thinners, stains) to the solvent stream (W5357).
Responsible (R): Take-Back Associate
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5353_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5353_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5353_Task7" name="Stage in the ventilated flame cabinet (W5349); log container count/volume to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Stage in the ventilated flame cabinet (W5349); log container count/volume to the store hazardous-waste ledger.
Responsible (R): Take-Back Associate
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5353_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5353_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5353_Task8" name="Issue loyalty points/incentive per policy (W5350).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Issue loyalty points/incentive per policy (W5350).
Responsible (R): Take-Back Associate
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5353_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5353_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5353_Task9" name="Flag usable volumes for reblending/donation (W5362) vs. recycling/disposal.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Flag usable volumes for reblending/donation (W5362) vs. recycling/disposal.
Responsible (R): Paint Dept Supervisor
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
