Responsible (R): Take-Back Associate
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5354_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5354_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5354_Task8" name="Issue incentive per policy (W5350).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Issue incentive per policy (W5350).
Responsible (R): Take-Back Associate
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5354_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5354_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5354_Task9" name="Monitor drum fill level; schedule bulk consolidation pickup before capacity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Monitor drum fill level; schedule bulk consolidation pickup before capacity (W5360).
Responsible (R): HSE Officer
Accountable (A): Take-Back Counter Associate
Duration: weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5354_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5354_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
